    "title_en": "Dileptons in heavy-ion collisions",
    "abstract_en": "In this review we give an overview about dileptons as probes for the properties of the strongly interacting hot and dense matter created in heavy-ion collisions at various beam energies. As penetrating probes they leave the fireball unaffected from final-state interactions and thus provide a space-time-evolution weighted average of the in-medium properties of hot and dense QCD matter.",
